  "question": {
    "text": "<p>The abscissa(e) of the point(s), where the tangent to curve <math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></math> is parallel to the&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>-axis&nbsp;is(are)</p>\r",
